这完全地、唯一地由到和从它的态射来表征。

328
00:21:18,840 --> 00:21:24,840
exclusively by morphisms to and from it.
让我们问一个更复杂的问题。

329
00:21:24,840 --> 00:21:27,840
Let's ask a more complicated question.
什么情况下一个空间 N 是连通的？

330
00:21:27,840 --> 00:21:29,840
When is a space N connected?
(已与上一条字幕合并)

331
00:21:29,840 --> 00:21:32,840
So when it consists of only one piece.
所以当它只由一个部分组成时。

332
00:21:41,840 --> 00:21:45,840
Or more generally, can we somehow express,
或者更一般地，我们能否 somehow 表达，

333
00:21:45,840 --> 00:21:48,840
let's say the very first homotopia set,
说第一个同伦集，

334
00:21:48,840 --> 00:21:52,840
the set of pieces, purely in categorical terms?
部件的集合，纯粹用范畴论的语言？

335
00:21:52,840 --> 00:21:54,840
It turns out that yes, we can.
结果是，我们可以。

336
00:21:54,840 --> 00:21:56,840
So let's try to play this game.
所以让我们尝试玩这个游戏。

337
00:21:56,840 --> 00:21:58,840
So first of all, we know what is the set of points
首先，我们知道空间中的点集

338
00:21:58,840 --> 00:21:59,840
of the space.
是从点到这个空间的态射集。

339
00:21:59,840 --> 00:22:03,840
It's the set of morphisms from the point to this space.
我们已经刻画了点。

340
00:22:03,840 --> 00:22:06,840
And we have already characterized the point
(已与上一条字幕合并)

341
00:22:06,840 --> 00:22:09,840
in some internal way.
以某种内部方式。

342
00:22:09,840 --> 00:22:13,840
Now, let's consider the unit interval.
现在，我们考虑单位区间。

343
00:22:13,840 --> 00:22:16,840
The set of maps from the unit interval, morphisms
单位区间到空间的映射集合，即态射集，是路径集合。

344
00:22:16,840 --> 00:22:20,840
from the unit interval to the space, is the set of paths.
现在我需要知道路径的起点和终点是什么。

345
00:22:24,840 --> 00:22:26,840
Now, I need to know what is the beginning of the path
为此，我需要态射复合的概念。

346
00:22:26,840 --> 00:22:29,840
and what is the end of the path.
所以如果我有一条路径，那么单位区间上有两个特殊的点，0 和 1，

347
00:22:29,840 --> 00:22:32,840
For that, I need the notion of a composition of morphisms.
它们是从点到单位区间的态射。

348
00:22:32,840 --> 00:22:37,840
So if I have a path, I have two distinguished points, 0 and 1,
(已与上一条字幕合并)

349
00:22:37,840 --> 00:22:40,840
on the unit interval, which are morphisms from the point
(已与上一条字幕合并)

350
00:22:40,840 --> 00:22:42,840
to the unit interval.
(已与上一条字幕合并)

351
00:22:42,840 --> 00:22:46,840
If I look at the composition, my path composed
如果我查看复合路径，这条路径与其中一个点复合后，

352
00:22:46,840 --> 00:22:50,840
with one of these points, I get a point of the space,
我得到空间中的一个点，这是路径的起点或终点。

353
00:22:50,840 --> 00:22:53,840
which is the beginning or the end of the path.
因此仅使用范畴结构，

354
00:22:53,840 --> 00:22:58,840
So using purely the structure of the category,
我知道哪些是点集。

355
00:22:58,840 --> 00:22:59,840
I know what is the set of points.
我知道哪些是路径集。

356
00:22:59,840 --> 00:23:01,840
I know what is the set of paths.
并且我知道如何给一条路径指定起点和终点。

357
00:23:01,840 --> 00:23:05,840
And I know how to assign beginning and end to a path.
现在我可以说明组成部分的集合是什么了，

358
00:23:05,840 --> 00:23:09,840
So now I can say what is the set of pieces,
因为我只是必须识别可以通过路径连接的两点，换句话说，

359
00:23:09,840 --> 00:23:14,840
because it's simply I have to identify two points which
(已与上一条字幕合并)

360
00:23:14,840 --> 00:23:16,840
can be connected by a path, in other words,
(已与上一条字幕合并)

361
00:23:16,840 --> 00:23:19,840
for which there is a path such that it's beginning and end.
其中有路径使得其起点和终点。

362
00:23:19,840 --> 00:23:22,840
And that gives me the set pi 0.
这就给了我集合 π₀。

363
00:23:22,840 --> 00:23:26,840
So the only thing which is here, which is not internal
所以这里唯一不在范畴内的是

364
00:23:26,840 --> 00:23:30,840
to the category of categorical structure,
原子结构范畴内的东西，

365
00:23:30,840 --> 00:23:31,840
is the unit interval itself.
就是单位区间本身。

366
00:23:31,840 --> 00:23:36,840
We don't know how to characterize it from the inside.
我们不知道如何从内部对其进行描述。

367
00:23:36,840 --> 00:23:40,840
But as soon as I have a category and something which
但只要我有一个范畴并且想要称呼这个单位区间为两个映射，

368
00:23:40,840 --> 00:23:44,840
I want to call the unit interval with two maps,
A 和 B，分别称为起点和终点，

369
00:23:44,840 --> 00:23:46,840
A and B, called beginning and end,
我就可以定义某种 π₀。

370
00:23:46,840 --> 00:23:49,840
I can define some kind of pi 0.
