375
00:24:09,840 --> 00:24:17,840
But what I will need to know will be the object point,
但我需要知道的是对象点，

376
00:24:17,840 --> 00:24:19,840
the object called unit interval.
称为单位区间的一个对象。

377
00:24:19,840 --> 00:24:23,840
And then I'll need to know to have some distinguished object
然后我还需要知道一个特殊的对象

378
00:24:23,840 --> 00:24:27,840
which is called the square.
它被称为正方形。

379
00:24:27,840 --> 00:24:30,840
And some finite number of morphisms
连接这些对象的一些有限态射。

380
00:24:30,840 --> 00:24:32,840
connecting these objects.
(已与上一条字幕合并)

381
00:24:32,840 --> 00:24:35,840
As soon as I have such a purely combinatorial structure
一但我有了这样一个纯粹组合结构

382
00:24:35,840 --> 00:24:39,840
inside my category, I can consider morphisms
在我的范畴内部，我可以考虑态射

383
00:24:39,840 --> 00:24:43,840
with values in any object and get something which
值在任何对象上并得到一些东西

384
00:24:43,840 --> 00:24:45,840
I will call pi 0 and pi 1.
我会称之为 π₀ 和 π₁。

385
00:24:45,840 --> 00:24:49,840
I can continue that and model formally in any category.
我可以继续这样做并在任何范畴中形式化。

386
00:24:53,840 --> 00:24:55,840
Basically, for what I'm talking about,
基本上，就我谈论的内容而言，

387
00:24:55,840 --> 00:24:57,840
it's enough to understand pi 0.
理解 π₀ 就足够了。

388
00:24:57,840 --> 00:25:06,840
And the rest is just not to look too elementary.
而其余部分只是不要太基础。

389
00:25:06,840 --> 00:25:09,840
So one can formalize the situation
因此，可以形式化当有点、区间、正方形、立方体时的情况

390
00:25:09,840 --> 00:25:16,840
when one has point, interval, square, cube,
的情形。

391
00:25:16,840 --> 00:25:18,840
cube of the next dimension, and so on.
高一维的立方体，依次类推。

392
00:25:18,840 --> 00:25:22,840
Now all these things in usual topological world
现在这所有的东西在通常拓扑世界中

