00:26:22,840 --> 00:26:27,840
but it will work somehow.
但它会以某种方式起作用。

412
00:26:27,840 --> 00:26:36,840
Now let's go to the next...
现在让我们进入下一个...

413
00:26:48,840 --> 00:26:51,840
So of course that was just an example.
当然，这只是个例子。

414
00:26:51,840 --> 00:26:55,840
In principle, there are many more structures,
在原则上，还有许多更多的结构，

415
00:26:55,840 --> 00:26:57,840
let's say in topological spaces,
比如拓扑空间中的，

416
00:26:57,840 --> 00:27:00,840
which are needed for homotopy theory.
对同伦理论来说是必需的。

417
00:27:00,840 --> 00:27:04,840
So one can translate most of the structures
因此可以将大多数结构

418
00:27:04,840 --> 00:27:06,840
into categorical terms,
转换成范畴论的语言，

419
00:27:06,840 --> 00:27:11,840
as I tried to show in this example of cubical spaces.
就像我在立方空间的例子中尝试展示的那样。

420
00:27:11,840 --> 00:27:14,840
And then as soon as they are translated
然后一旦它们被转换

421
00:27:14,840 --> 00:27:16,840
into these formal categorical terms,
用这些形式化的范畴术语来表达，

422
00:27:16,840 --> 00:27:19,840
one can try to take some very different category
可以尝试取一个非常不同的范畴

423
00:27:19,840 --> 00:27:22,840
and apply it there and see what happens.
然后应用到那里看看会发生什么。

424
00:27:22,840 --> 00:27:24,840
So material homotopy theory happens
所谓的材料同伦理论发生在

425
00:27:24,840 --> 00:27:28,840
when one applies this kind of procedure
当将这种程序应用于

426
00:27:28,840 --> 00:27:31,840
to the following category of algebraic equations,
下列代数方程的范畴时，

427
00:27:31,840 --> 00:27:34,840
systems of algebraic equations,
代数方程系统，

428
00:27:34,840 --> 00:27:36,840
which I'm going to describe in a moment.
我一会儿会描述它们。

429
00:27:36,840 --> 00:27:40,840
That's not exactly the standard approach to algebraic geometry,
这并不是代数几何的标准方法，

430
00:27:40,840 --> 00:27:45,840
but that's the most elementary one which I could think of.
但这是我能想到的最基础的方法。

431
00:27:45,840 --> 00:27:48,840
So let's consider the following objects,
所以让我们考虑以下对象，

432
00:27:48,840 --> 00:27:51,840
which we call systems of algebraic equations.
我们称之为代数方程组系统。

433
00:27:51,840 --> 00:27:53,840
So by definition, a system of algebraic equations
由定义，一个代数方程组系统

434
00:27:53,840 --> 00:27:55,840
