是如下装置。

435
00:27:55,840 --> 00:27:57,840
It's first of all a list of letters
首先是一系列字母

436
00:27:57,840 --> 00:27:59,840
which are called variables of the system,
称为系统的变量，

437
00:27:59,840 --> 00:28:03,840
and second of all some list of polynomials in these variables
其次是一些这些变量的多项式列表

438
00:28:03,840 --> 00:28:06,840
which are called equations of the system.
称为系统的方程式。

439
00:28:06,840 --> 00:28:08,840
So here is an example.
这是一个例子。

440
00:28:08,840 --> 00:28:10,840
There is one variable X
有一个变量 X

441
00:28:10,840 --> 00:28:13,840
and one equation X squared plus one.
以及一个方程 \(X^2 + 1\).

442
00:28:13,840 --> 00:28:15,840
Here is another example.
这是另一个例子。

443
00:28:15,840 --> 00:28:18,840
There are N variables, X1, XN,
有 N 个变量，\(X_1, X_N\)，

444
00:28:18,840 --> 00:28:21,840
and there are no equations whatsoever.
并且没有任何方程。

445
00:28:21,840 --> 00:28:25,840
That's a very important system which is denoted by AN.
那是一个非常重要的系统，记作 \(A_N\)。

446
00:28:27,840 --> 00:28:30,840
Here is a more sophisticated example.
这是一个更复杂的例子。

447
00:28:30,840 --> 00:28:34,840
I'm sorry, I was getting late writing it,
对不起，我写晚了，

448
00:28:34,840 --> 00:28:37,840
and it's not probably very readable.
而且可能不太容易读。

449
00:28:37,840 --> 00:28:41,840
I have N squared variables.
我有 \(N^2\) 个变量。

450
00:28:41,840 --> 00:28:46,840
I'm thinking about them as about entries in a matrix
我把它们当作矩阵中的元素来考虑。

451
00:28:46,840 --> 00:28:49,840
plus one additional variable which I call T.
除此之外，还有一个变量 T。

452
00:28:49,840 --> 00:28:51,840
And I have one equation which says
我有一个方程，说的是

453
00:28:51,840 --> 00:28:55,840
it's the determinant of this matrix times T minus one.
这个矩阵的行列式乘以 T 减一。

454
00:28:55,840 --> 00:28:58,840
Well, it doesn't say anything, but that's my equation.
好吧，这并没有说什么，但这就是我的方程。

455
00:28:58,840 --> 00:29:01,840
That's my polynomial.
这是我的多项式。

456
00:29:01,840 --> 00:29:05,840
And such a system of equations I want to denote by GLN.
而这样的方程系统我希望表示为 GLN。

457
00:29:06,840 --> 00:29:10,840
Now, let's define morphisms.
现在，我们来定义态射。

458
00:29:15,840 --> 00:29:18,840
Oh, I need to say something else.
哦，我还需要说一些其他的事情。

459
00:29:18,840 --> 00:29:22,840
So now I want to try to define
现在我想尝试定义

460
00:29:22,840 --> 00:29:26,840
the category of systems of algebraic equations.
方程系统的范畴。

461
00:29:28,840 --> 00:29:31,840
So what I need first are
首先我需要的是对象，作为对象我会取...

462
00:29:31,840 --> 00:29:34,840
objects, and as objects I will take...
对象，作为对象我会取...

463
00:29:34,840 --> 00:29:36,840
I want to sort of say let's consider
我想说的是让我们考虑

464
00:29:36,840 --> 00:29:38,840
all systems of algebraic equations,
所有代数方程系统，

465
00:29:38,840 --> 00:29:40,840
but that's a bit too many.
但这有点太多了。

466
00:29:40,840 --> 00:29:44,840
So a typical approach is we first choose
因此一个典型的办法是我们首先选择

467
00:29:44,840 --> 00:29:47,840
what kind of coefficients are we going to consider.
我们要考虑什么样的系数。

468
00:29:47,840 --> 00:29:51,840
So let's take some system of coefficients,
那么我们取一些系数系统，

469
00:29:51,840 --> 00:29:55,840
integral numbers or real numbers or complex numbers,
整数或实数或复数，

470
00:29:55,840 --> 00:29:59,840
and consider all systems with the same coefficients.
并考虑具有相同系数的所有系统。

471
00:29:59,840 --> 00:30:01,840
And consider all systems with coefficients
考虑所有带有这种数作为系数的系统。

472
00:30:01,840 --> 00:30:05,840
in this type of numbers.
这些将是我们的范畴中的对象类。

473
00:30:05,840 --> 00:30:09,840
That will be the class of objects of our category.
现在我需要从一个系统到另一个系统的态射。

474
00:30:11,840 --> 00:30:14,840
Now I need morphisms from one system to another.
所以我试着写下来，

475
00:30:14,840 --> 00:30:17,840
So I tried to write it down,
但在投影仪上很难看清楚。

476
00:30:17,840 --> 00:30:22,840
and it's difficult to read on a projector.
因此，通过态射我希望表示变量的变化。

477
00:30:22,840 --> 00:30:27,840
So by morphism I want to mean a change of variables.
所以从变量 x 的一个系统

478
00:30:27,840 --> 00:30:31,840
So a morphism from one system in variables x
到另一个变量 y 的系统的态射

479
00:30:31,840 --> 00:30:34,840
to another system in variables y
将是某种表达变量 y 的方式。

480
00:30:34,840 --> 00:30:37,840
is going to be some way to express variables y
(已与上一条字幕合并)

481
00:30:37,840 --> 00:30:41,840
through variables x, such that the equations
通过变量 x，使得方程在两边近似成立。

482
00:30:41,840 --> 00:30:45,840
sort of are satisfied on both sides.
这种关系在两边都近似满足。

483
00:30:45,840 --> 00:30:48,840
There is some obvious way to compose these things.
这些东西有一种显然的组合方式。

484
00:30:48,840 --> 00:30:50,840
It wasn't I who invented this.
我不是发明这个的人。

485
00:30:50,840 --> 00:30:52,840
I don't know who invented it,
我不知道是谁发明的，

486
00:30:52,840 --> 00:30:54,840
but I read it in a wonderful textbook
但我在一本精彩的教科书里读到过

487
00:30:54,840 --> 00:30:58,840
by Manin on algebraic geometry,
关于代数几何的著作，

488
00:30:58,840 --> 00:31:00,840
which was published in Soviet Union
它在20世纪60年代末期出版于苏联。

489
00:31:00,840 --> 00:31:03,840
in the end of the 60s.
所以这里有一个例子。

490
00:31:05,840 --> 00:31:09,840
So here is an example.
这是一个例子。

491
00:31:09,840 --> 00:31:11,840
Let's consider A0.
让我们考虑 A0。

492
00:31:11,840 --> 00:31:14,840
So remember A0 is...
所以记得 A0 是...

493
00:31:16,840 --> 00:31:18,840
Let me do it this way.
我就用这种方式来做。

494
00:31:19,840 --> 00:31:27,840
A0 is a system of no equations and no variables.
A0 是一个没有方程也没有变量的系统。

495
00:31:27,840 --> 00:31:32,840
So a morphism from such a system
因此，从这样一个系统的态射

496
00:31:32,840 --> 00:31:40,840
would mean that I have to find expressions of my x1, xn
